  <metadata>
    <name>Day 4 (OPTIONAL) - Los Angeles to San Diego (with waypoints)</name>
    <desc>The optional extension. Out of Union Station on the Los Angeles River path to Long Beach, the Orange County beach cities, then the San Diego North County coast to Santa Fe Depot. Camp Pendleton is bypassed on the Caltrans-permitted I-5 shoulder, so no base pass is needed; see pch_day4_alt_pendleton.gpx for the through-the-base line.</desc>
    <time>2026-08-08T17:07:44Z</time>
  </metadata>
